    kind: work_item  # c31c
    title: "Producer-axis ratchet: value_flow resolves x.kind against every record class with a kind field, ignoring x's annotated type (false positive)"  # c31c
    status: todo_hard  # c31c
    priority: 3  # c31c
    parent:  # c31c
    tags:  # c31c
    - analysis_quality  # c31c
    isbefore: []  # c31c
    duplicate_of: []  # c31c
    not_duplicate_of: []  # c31c
    pr_ref:  # c31c
    description: "FALSE POSITIVE in the producer-axis ratchet (scripts/check-producer-axis-coherence -> hypergumbo_core.producer_coherence.unregistered_symbol_kinds -> hypergumbo_core.value_flow). value_flow._attribute resolves an attribute read `x.kind` against EVERY module-local @dataclass/NamedTuple that declares a field named `kind`, whatever `x` is (the module docstring lists this as the documented unsoundness of \"typing the object of an attribute read\"). When a module holds two record classes with a same-named field, one class's construction values are attributed to reads of the other's.\n\nREPRO (dev c5561d4a93, elixir.py has two NamedTuples with a `kind` field: _FunctionKey(full_name, kind, arity) and _Directive(kind=\"use\"/\"behaviour\", ...)): in _function_symbol (elixir.py ~2581, `key: _FunctionKey` is the parameter) replace `kind = _def_kind(clauses[0][1])` with `kind = key.kind`, then run `scripts/check-producer-axis-coherence`. Observed: exit 1, \"Symbol.kind: 'behaviour' emitted at: .../elixir.py:2590\" and \"'use' emitted at: .../elixir.py:2590\" -- values only _Directive is ever constructed with. With the committed workaround (kind derived from the def keyword) the check exits 0. B2 of WI-tusad shipped that workaround.\n\nROOT CAUSE: no receiver typing at all, even when the receiver is a parameter the function annotates with one of the candidate record classes.\n\nFIX SHAPE: narrow the candidate classes to the one the receiver's own declaration names, when the receiver is a Name whose only binding in its scope is an annotated parameter (or an annotated assignment) whose annotation is a module-local record class (`key: _FunctionKey` or the string form). Otherwise keep today's union (sound default). Not a governance file: the logic lives in packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/value_flow.py; scripts/check-producer-axis-coherence is only the wrapper."  # c31c
    fields: {}  # c31c
